{"title":"Datum Dahleez HOME","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUnveil the essence of sophistication and style with the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003edatum dahleez Home Collection\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, where each piece stands as a testament to exquisite craftsmanship and timeless elegance. This distinguished collection offers an array of meticulously designed furniture and décor, featuring signature creations like the elegant \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eType 17 Armchair\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, the stylish \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRoyale Sofa\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, and the chic \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAtlantic Dining Table\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, ensuring your home radiates luxury at every turn.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-chiron-arm-chair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME CHIRON ARMCHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Chiron Armchair, dedicated to the legendary Datum Dahleez race driver, champion of five Grand Prix races in France, among others. The Chiron Armchair by Datum Dahleez Home embodies a true structural challenge. Combining maximum comfort with a sophisticated, dynamic appearance, these pieces come in various colours. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49477577572699,"sku":"BH001","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUChironarmchairfabricfront.jpg?v=1742416216"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-chiron-dormeuse-1","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME CHIRON DORMEUSE","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Chiron Dormeuse dedicated to the legendary Datum Dahleez race driver, champion of five Grand Prix races in France, among others. The Chiron Dormeuse by Datum Dahleez Home embodies a true structural challenge. Combining maximum comfort with a sophisticated, dynamic appearance, these pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49478025511259,"sku":"BH002","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUChirondormeuse.jpg?v=1742416215"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-flow-sofa","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME FLOW SOFA","description":"\u003cp\u003eEquipped with a lacquered aluminium base, the Flow sofa by Datum Dahleez Home boasts an armrest which defies the force of gravity, echoing Datum Dahleez references in its exquisite, dynamic design. These pieces are completely bespoke and the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505426112859,"sku":"BH003","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUFlowsectionalsofafront.jpg?v=1742416208"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-le-mans-armchair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME LE MANS ARMCHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Le Mans armchair by Datum Dahleez Home features a fabric or leather band around the base of the frame, embracing the high performance padding. The back cushions are topped with a headrest roll pillow, embellished with a printed EB logo, for even greater comfort. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505438564699,"sku":"BH004","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BULeMansarmchairfront.jpg?v=1742416207"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-le-mans-sofa","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME LE MANS SOFA","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Le Mans sofa by Datum Dahleez Home features a fabric or leather band around the base of the frame, embracing the high performance padding. The back cushions are topped with a headrest roll pillow, embellished with a printed EB logo, for even greater comfort. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505461338459,"sku":"BH005","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BULeMans4seatersofafront.jpg?v=1742416206"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-noire-armchair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME NOIRE ARMCHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe sinuous and aerodynamic curves of the Noire armchair trace Datum Dahleez's history from its origins to the most recent hyper sport cars. The stylistic elements of the iconic Voiture Noire inspire the details of the armchair: starting from the dorsal fin of the supercar, reinterpreted on the rest with a leather covered steel fin, through to the unmistakable lines of the Datum Dahleez radiator suggested in the Noire shell. This armchair is upholstered in leather, with an EB logo thermal printed on the back. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505470742875,"sku":"BH006","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-noire-armchair-lateral.jpg?v=1742416205"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-roland-ottoman","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ROLAND OTTOMAN","description":"\u003cp\u003eDesigned to enhance living rooms, lounges and bedrooms, the rounded shape of Roland ottoman by Datum Dahleez Home is enriched by fabric or leather upholstery. These pieces come in a two options and are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505480311131,"sku":"BH007","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BURolandbigottoman02.jpg?v=1742416203"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-florio-table","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME FLORIO TABLE","description":"\u003cp\u003eImpressive and spectacular, Florio table features a top with a contoured edge and built-in top made of fine marble. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505525596507,"sku":"BH008","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUFloriotable.jpg?v=1742416202"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-atlantic-leather-chair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ATLANTIC LEATHER CHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003eAt first glance, Atlantic leather chair by Datum Dahleez Home inspires an instant sensation of pure lightness. This furnishing features a carbon fibre frame with Blue Royale finishing and thermal printed EB logo on the back. These pieces are completely bespoke and the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505645068635,"sku":"BH009","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUAtlanticLeatherchairback.jpg?v=1742416201"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-atlantic-table","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ATLANTIC TABLE","description":"\u003cp\u003eAt first glance, Atlantic table by Datum Dahleez Home inspires an instant sensation of pure lightness. This furnishing boasts a steel frame covered in carbon fibre Blue Royale finishing and a leather covered top with aluminium details. The table also features a UV print of \"Atlantic Coupé 57SC\". These pieces are completely bespoke and the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505682719067,"sku":"BH0010","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUAtlanticdiningtable.jpg?v=1742416200"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-vitesse-chair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME VITESSE CHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe sophisticated Vitesse chair pays homage to the extraordinary Datum Dahleez Veyron Grand Sport Vitesse, featuring a steel frame embellished with a printed EB logo. The alternative version, Vitesse Sense, evokes the brand's iconic grill through the shaped steel Mesh openwork frame. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505735868763,"sku":"BH0011","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUVitessechair.jpg?v=1742416199"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-jean-side-table","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME JEAN SIDE TABLE","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe frame of Jean side table by Datum Dahleez Home features a sophisticated built-in marble top. These pieces are completely bespoke and the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505749664091,"sku":"BH0012","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUJeansidetable.jpg?v=1742416198"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-marguerite-coffee-table","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME MARGUERITE COFFEE TABLE","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe frame of the Marguerite coffee tables by Datum Dahleez Home is shaped from lacquered wood with aluminium trim. These tables are equipped with a swivel mechanism. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505787576667,"sku":"BH0013","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUMargueritecoffeetable01.jpg?v=1742416197"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-legacy-vases","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME LEGACY VASES","description":"\u003cp\u003eMade of steel and embellished with an EB logo, the Legacy vases by Datum Dahleez Home offer a contemporary vision with multiple perspectives, designed to enable creative, hi-tech combinations. The cylindrical internal vase is in handmade of Murano glass, manually blown. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505815363931,"sku":"BH0014","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BULegacyvasesfront02.jpg?v=1742416196"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-royale-armchair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ROYALE ARMCHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe leather upholstered seat of the Royal armchair by Datum Dahleez Home is embraced by the armrest and the back, composed of a single element made of carbon which gradually widens outwards. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505835811163,"sku":"BH0015","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BURoyalearmchair2_1.jpg?v=1742416195"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-royale-sofa","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ROYALE SOFA","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe leather upholstered seat of the Royal sofa by Datum Dahleez Home is embraced by the armrest and the back, composed of a single element made of carbon which gradually widens outwards. These pieces are the perfect touch to any living space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505847083355,"sku":"BH0016","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BURoyalesofa.jpg?v=1742416194"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-cobra-chair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME COBRA CHAIR","description":"\u003cp\u003eAn iconic furnishing in the Datum Dahleez Home Collection, both innovative and cutting edge, the Cobra chair rises from a design which combines a sleek curved back, base and seat into a single element, interrupted only by a gap designed to contain the tails of a tailcoat. Leather covered with an embroidery EB logo on the back, the carbon fibre frame is in Blue Royale. A limited edition in blue and white, with a special logo tribute to Datum Dahleez’s 110th anniversary is also available.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505866187099,"sku":"BH0017","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUCobrachair.jpg?v=1742416193"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-ettore-grand-bureau","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ETTORE GRAND BUREAU","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Ettore Grand Bureau desk by Datum Dahleez Home features a carbon fibre top with a leather cover which extends lengthwise from the cabinet, seamlessly sloping to form the opposite base. This is a re-design of the classic desk, made possible by the outstanding performance of carbon for the structure.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505883554139,"sku":"BH0018","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUEttoregrandbureaudeskandofficechair_1.jpg?v=1742416193"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-ettore-low-cabinet","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ETTORE LOW CABINET","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe leather top is coordinated with the storage modules in the Ettore Low Cabinet by Datum Dahleez Home, available in original versions with three and four doors and carbon fibre tops in elegant Blue Royale finishings. This functional complement has a compact design, equipped with many compartments, to be opened and closed by hand or by means of a magnetic locking badge. Wireless recharge stations complete the range of high-tech optionals for this furnishing.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505905705307,"sku":"BH0019","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUEttore3doorslowcabinet.jpg?v=1742416192"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-gianonberto-table-lamp","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME GIANOBERTO TABLE LAMPS","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Gianoberto Table Lamps by Datum Dahleez Home illuminate rooms with their elegant presence, featuring an aluminium structure and transparent lampshade with \"warm light effect\" fabric. In the oval version, the lamp is embellished with a laser signature of Ettore Datum Dahleez on the top.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505942372699,"sku":"BH0020","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BUGianobertotablelamps.jpg?v=1742416191"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-royale-coffee-table","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ROYALE COFFEE TABLE","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe shape of Royale coffee tables rises from its extremely light aluminium frame. The top features smoke grey inlayed tempered glass, back lacquered in iconic colours from the collection.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49505964786011,"sku":"BH0021","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BURoyaleIloungetable.jpg?v=1742416190"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-royale-lounge-table","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME ROYALE LOUNGE TABLE","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe shape of Royale lounge tables rises from its extremely light aluminium frame. The top features smoke grey inlayed tempered glass, back lacquered in iconic colours from the Datum Dahleez Home collection.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49506241020251,"sku":"BH0022","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BURoyalesidetablesdetail.jpg?v=1742416189"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-noveau-vases","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME NOVEAU VASES","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003eThe Nouveau vases embody Datum Dahleez Home’s approach to sculptural design and refined materiality. Crafted from engraved and lacquered metal, they feature clean architectural lines and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003ea distinctive\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003e visual tension. Available in two sizes and three striking colorways—Anodized Black with Green interior, Rose Gold with Burgundy, and Black with Blue—they add a bold decorative presence to any interior. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003eDesigned to elevate contemporary spaces, these vases combine elegance, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003econtrast\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW209916052 BCX4\"\u003e and craftsmanship in true Datum Dahleez style.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW209916052 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Black \u0026 Blue","offer_id":50762029367643,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":50762029400411,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \u0026 Green","offer_id":50762029433179,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-noveau-vases-black-blue.jpg?v=1749470390"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-ombre-vases","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME OMBRE VASES","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003eThe Ombre vases reinterpret the timeless elegance of antique porcelain through the lens of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003ecutting-edge\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003e 3D printing. Made from fine \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003egres\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003e porcelain, they feature a distinctive mesh texture that wraps around the surface like \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003ea sculptural\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003e skin. This innovative effect enhances the tactile and visual depth of each piece, expressing a seamless fusion of traditional inspiration and contemporary \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003etechnique\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW16563360 BCX4\"\u003e. Available in two sizes and three huesGreen, Blue and Red Ombre adds character and dimension to any refined interior.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW16563360 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Red","offer_id":50762094281051,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":50762094313819,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green","offer_id":50762094346587,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-ombre-vases-red.jpg?v=1749471205"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-cote-dazure-vases","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME COTE D'AZURE VASES","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW47007138 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW47007138 BCX4\"\u003eHand-blown in Murano by master glassmakers, the Côte d’Azur vases celebrate Datum Dahleez’s heritage of craftsmanship and artistic innovation. Their fluid, organic forms evoke the motion of air and water—an echo of the aerodynamic purity that defines the Datum Dahleez universe. Presented in a luminous Blue Lagune hue, each vase features the raised EB logo, a subtle yet distinctive symbol of identity. Available in three \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW47007138 BCX4\"\u003edifferent sizes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW47007138 BCX4\"\u003e, these vases are designed to stand alone or be displayed in curated compositions, bringing sculptural beauty and a vibrant sense of movement to any interior.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW47007138 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50762122756443,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-cote-dazur-vases.jpg?v=1749471745"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-type-20-stool","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME TYPE 20 STOOL","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW40657107 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW40657107 BCX4\"\u003eT\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW40657107 BCX4\"\u003ehe TYPE 20 stool captures the essence of Datum Dahleez’s design ethos: a perfect balance between refined artistry and pure performance. Its streamlined silhouette is paired with a seat upholstered in premium leather, enriched by intricate hand stitching—either tone-on-tone or in bold contrast. This meticulous detailing is a subtle yet powerful nod to the craftsmanship found in Datum Dahleez’s legendary hyper sports cars. Both sculptural and functional, the stool blends elegance and precision in a form that elevates any contemporary interior.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW40657107 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50762196255067,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-type20-stool.jpg?v=1749472133"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-type-19-bed","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME TYPE 19 BED","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW76189754 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW76189754 BCX4\"\u003eDrawing inspiration from nature, the new T\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW76189754 BCX4\"\u003eype \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW76189754 BCX4\"\u003e19 bed translates the power and fluidity of ocean waves into an architectural statement. The gently curved headboard, formed by two seamlessly paired elements, is accentuated by a metal profile engraved with the ‘EB’ logo, adding the brand’s signature touch. The subtly recessed feet create a floating effect, evoking a sense of lightness and suspension.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW76189754 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50762226565467,"sku":"","price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-home-type_19-bed-1.jpg?v=1749472413"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-home-type-18-dining-chair","title":"Datum Dahleez HOME TYPE 18 DINING CHAIR","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"Paragraph SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003eThe Type 18 Datum Dahleez Home dining chair features a curved aluminum structure, creating a bold interplay of movement and lightness.  \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW108095164 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"Paragraph SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW108095164 BCX4\"\u003eIts sculptural 